{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"卒業ライブが終わり数日経ちました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一番に思うのは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局歌は上手くならなかったなぁです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ、こんな生駒にソロパートなんて任せられないし。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもでも、もう少し上手くなりたかったなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか、私は歌上達出来る人なのかなぁ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"音痴だからな、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"水玉模様"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一回も上手に歌えなくてごめんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それだけが悔やまれます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ライブはすごーくすごーく楽しかった(*´꒳`*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって皆んなといっぱいパフォーマンス出来たし！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトが出てきたし！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てか！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"岸本斉史先生からイラスト頂いた(´；ω；｀)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな事起こっていい事なの⁈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナルトくんがコメントくれた(´；ω；｀)☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいのかなぁ。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1ファンだよ。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただのファンだよ。。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"。。。。こんな贅沢はもうないんだからな生駒、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからの修行、絶対投げ出すなよ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲間がいて、自分の名前がライブのタイトルに付いていて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歴史ある建物でライブが出来る"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんな事やらせていただけた事、本当に感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生生星と言ってファンの皆さんに好きだといってくださっています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実はね、そこに私がいるのがすごく怖かったんだ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初期はね、私が真ん中にいたら2人も悪く言われちゃうって思ってて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私なんか消えて、2人を見てっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってずっと思ってたなぁ。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とんだ厨二病野郎だな☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもその時は本気で思ってたんだよ笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},